     "repeat"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Soni and Avi make a mala with 8 beads, 4 of one colour and 4 of another.\nColour the beads in a string to show the malas you made. You may arrange them as 4 red then 4 blue, or red, blue, red, blue and so on.\nHow many different malas can you make with 4 red and 4 blue beads? Record each in a table.\nA pattern can be made with shapes, colours or numbers. 2, 4, 6, 8 grows by 2 each time.\nFind the rule: each pattern follows a rule that tells what comes next."
    }
